Package: device-port-monitor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-notify-0.7, systemd
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: Device Port Monitor contributors
Description: GNOME top-bar monitor for serial and video devices
 Shows ttyACM, ttyUSB, and video device counts in an AppIndicator,
 sends connection notifications, and provides a small autostart settings UI.
